{"benchmark": "razavi-bench", "schema_version": 3, "reference_scope": "visual-only-annotations", "visual_unit_id": "part2-figure-15", "part": "part2", "figure_number": 15, "subfigure": null, "figure_label": "Figure 15", "source_figure_path": "tasks/part2-018-ldo-regulator-generates-thermal-noise-with-spectrum/figure-15.png", "source_figure_sha256": "29b939b6357fe030e6c763229fe00a71371b087c3f3cd646807c9d7a20106b55", "crop_box": [0, 0, 2218, 1268], "task_mappings": [{"task_path": "tasks/part2-018-ldo-regulator-generates-thermal-noise-with-spectrum", "question_number": 18}], "netlist_paths": ["netlists/part2-figure-15-29b939b6/supply_pushing.cir"], "visual_annotation_zh": "B1、B2 虚线框内只画了一个代表性“电容 + 接地开关”支路，省略号表示还有未展开的并联单元；数量和控制信号未给出。两个电感在图中都写为 L1，应原样保留这一标签事实。", "visual_annotation_en": "Inside each B1/B2 dashed box, only one representative capacitor-plus-grounded-switch branch is drawn; the ellipsis denotes additional unexpanded parallel cells. Their count and control signals are not given. Both inductors are labeled L1 in the figure, and that labeling fact should be preserved as drawn.", "annotation_sha256": "37556ca6dae7f39cf3b2d12e880a64690906ea491b5bcee19b6b270e0702f94e", "translation_status": "model-translated-and-cross-checked", "review_status": "human-reviewed", "reviewed_at": "2026-07-22"}
