{"benchmark": "razavi-bench", "schema_version": 3, "reference_scope": "visual-only-annotations", "visual_unit_id": "part2-figure-17", "part": "part2", "figure_number": 17, "subfigure": null, "figure_label": "Figure 17", "source_figure_path": "tasks/part2-020-estimate-oscillation-frequency/figure-17.png", "source_figure_sha256": "e38834441ddebee5d30bc92e233eff9b68d332a2f5f3c56ba7bf83817ae0b73d", "crop_box": [0, 0, 1054, 1438], "task_mappings": [{"task_path": "tasks/part2-020-estimate-oscillation-frequency", "question_number": 20}], "netlist_paths": ["netlists/part2-figure-17-e3883444/coupled_lc_strong.cir", "netlists/part2-figure-17-e3883444/coupled_lc_weak.cir"], "visual_annotation_zh": "上下两条粗供电轨在图中没有画出彼此连接，也没有文字标签。中部两组长连线交叉但无连接点，表示跨振荡器耦合而非短接。", "visual_annotation_en": "The two thick upper supply rails are neither shown connected to each other nor textually labeled. The two long central interconnect groups cross without junction dots, indicating cross-oscillator coupling rather than a short circuit.", "annotation_sha256": "5b33b465c099b74cf9a2c67ce1802e62004f20027c8252ea5247a40a4002f0e0", "translation_status": "model-translated-and-cross-checked", "review_status": "human-reviewed", "reviewed_at": "2026-07-22"}
